  "bio": "Rania Koukoumi is a talented tattoo apprentice at Gem Love London, specializing in the illustrative style of tattoo art. Her work, meticulous and creative, reflects her dedication to perfecting her craft within the bustling London scene. Clients appreciate Rania's professionalism, which she maintains consistently whether inking in the United Kingdom or back in her hometown of Kavala, Greece.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: London, England, United Kingdom"
